4\u0621\u0650 \u0631\u064e\u0628\u0651\u0650\u0647\u0650\u0645\u0652 \u064a\u064f\u0624\u0652\u0645\u0650\u0646\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e","indoText":"Kemudian Kami telah memberikan kepada Musa Kitab (Taurat) untuk menyempurnakan (nikmat Kami) kepada orang yang berbuat kebaikan, untuk menjelaskan segala sesuatu, dan sebagai petunjuk dan rahmat, agar mereka beriman akan adanya pertemuan dengan Tuhannya.","enText":"Then We gave Moses the Scripture, making complete [Our favor] upon the one who did good and as a detailed explanation of all things and as guidance and mercy that perhaps in [the matter of] the meeting with their Lord they would believe.","readText":"\u1e61umma \u0101tain\u0101 m\u1ee5sal-kit\u0101ba tam\u0101man 'alalla\u017c\u012b a\u1e25sana wa taf\u1e63\u012blal likulli syai`iw wa hudaw wa ra\u1e25matal la'allahum biliq\u0101`i rabbihim yu`min\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\/Alafasy_64kbps\/006154.mp3","juz":8,"manzil":2,"page":149,"ruku":120,"hizbQuarter":60,"sajda":false},{"verseId":155,"ayahText":"\u0648\u064e\u0647\u0670\u0630\u064e\u0627 \u0643\u0650\u062a\u0670\u0628\u064c \u0627\u064e\u0646\u0652\u0632\u064e\u0644\u0652\u0646\u0670\u0647\u064f \u0645\u064f\u0628\u0670\u0631\u064e\u0643\u064c \u0641\u064e\u0627\u062a\u0651\u064e\u0628\u0650\u0639\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0647\u064f \u0648\u064e\u0627\u062a\u0651\u064e\u0642\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0627 \u0644\u064e\u0639\u064e\u0644\u0651\u064e\u0643\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u062a\u064f\u0631\u0652\u062d\u064e\u0645\u064f\u0648\u0652\u0646\u064e\u06d9","indoText":"Dan ini adalah Kitab (Al-Qur'an) yang Kami turunkan dengan penuh berkah. Ikutilah, dan bertakwalah agar kamu mendapat rahmat,","enText":"And this [Qur'an] is a Book We have revealed [which is] blessed, so follow it and fear Allah that you may receive mercy.","readText":"wa h\u0101\u017c\u0101 kit\u0101bun anzaln\u0101hu mub\u0101rakun fattabi'\u1ee5hu wattaq\u1ee5 la'allakum tur-\u1e25am\u1ee5n","audio":"https:\/\/everyayah.com\/data\